                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1162100                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR ARTIKELFIL OCH W11603(BY-BACK FIL) OCH        *        
*                SKAPAR FIL SOM SEDAN MATCHAS NED NDC-FILERNA          *        
*                W01184 (NDC-CN). SKAPAR FIL SOM LIGGER TILL           *        
*                GRUND FÖR UPPDATERINGAR TILL VIPS.                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  MATCHES PARTS FILE AND W11603 (BUY-BACK FILE) AND     *        
*                CREATES THE MATCH FILE FOR NDC-CN W01184              *        
*                WHICH IS USED FOR UPDATING VIPS.                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  RAHUL JAIN                                            *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  OKTOBER 2011                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  W11604 BUY-BACK FIL                 *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11621D1                                                                   
%W11604   'BB-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  W11609 ARTIKELINFO                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11621D2                                                                   
%W11606   'ART-'                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  W01184-FILER NDC-INFORMATION        *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11621D3                                                                   
%W01184   'IN84-'                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11621D4 FB (311 0)                                                        
%W11610A   'UT-'                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  TEMPFILER                           *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
FILE TEMPFIL1 FB (428 0)                                                        
%W11606   'TMP-ART-'                                                            
*                                                                               
FILE NDCFIL   FB (42 0)                                                         
NDC-IDARTNR         1  5 P 0                                                    
NDC-IDDC            6  2 A                                                      
NDC-IDLEVNR         8  5 A                                                      
NDC-KDLEVSP        13  2 P 0                                                    
NDC-FLORDSP        15  1 A                                                      
NDC-KDREFSTA       16  1 A                                                      
NDC-KDARTURS       17  2 A                                                      
NDC-KVLS           19  4  P 0                                                   
NDC-KVAKS          23  4  P 0                                                   
NDC-KVOKS          27  4  P 0                                                   
NDC-KVRESS         31  4  P 0                                                   
NDC-KVROS          35  4  P 0                                                   
NDC-KVPB-SEP       39  4  P 1                                                   
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  PARAMETRAR TILL WDATKONV            *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
%WDATAREA                                                                       
*                                                                               
%WWDC99                                                                         
*                                                                               
WS-IDDC-DC70              W  2 A VALUE '70'                                     
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  ARBETSFÄLT                          *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
*                                                                               
 W-ORDERING               W  5 P 0 OCCURS 8                                     
 W-SUORDERTRAFF           W  5 P 0 VALUE 0                                      
 W-SUORDERING             W  5 P 0 VALUE 0                                      
 W-DISP-TOT               W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVLS-TOT               W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVAKS-TOT              W  4 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KVOKS-TOT              W  5 P   VALUE 0                                      
 W-KDBBCL                 W  1 N                                                
 JA                       W  1 A   VALUE 'J'                                    
 NEJ                      W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 IX1                      W  2 N   VALUE 0                                      
 IX2                      W  1 N   VALUE 0                                      
 DATUM1                   W  8 A                                                
 AA1     DATUM1              2 A                                                
 MM1     DATUM1 +3           2 A                                                
 DD1     DATUM1 +6           2 A                                                
 DATUM2                   W  6 A                                                
 AA2     DATUM2              2 A                                                
 MM2     DATUM2 +2           2 A                                                
 DD2     DATUM2 +4           2 A                                                
 DATUM   DATUM2              6 N                                                
 HELP-DATE                W  5 N                                                
 HELP-YY   HELP-DATE         2 N                                                
 HELP-WW   HELP-DATE +2      2 N                                                
 HELP-DAY  HELP-DATE +4      1 N                                                
 FKNGRP-BUYBACK           W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK1        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK2        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 PRODSLAG-BUYBACK3        W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 WDATKONV                 W  8 A   VALUE 'WDATKONV'                             
 WS-ART-OK                W  1 A   VALUE 'N'                                    
 W-KDSTANAUTG             W  1 A   VALUE ' '                                    
 W-FLBLOCK                W  1 A   VALUE ' '                                    
 W-TOT-LAGER              W  5 P 0                                              
 W-FORBRUKNING            W  5 P 0                                              
 W-IDFKNGRP               W  4 N                                                
 W-IDFKNGRP-SERIE W-IDFKNGRP 2 N                                                
 SUM-KVLS                 W  4  P  0 VALUE 0.                                   
 SUM-KVAKS                W  4  P  0 VALUE 0.                                   
 SUM-KVOKS                W  4  P  0 VALUE 0.                                   
 SUM-KVRESS               W  4  P  0 VALUE 0.                                   
 SUM-KVROS                W  4  P  0 VALUE 0.                                   
 SUM-KVPB-SEP             W  4  P  1 VALUE 0.                                   
 WS-TIFINLV               W  5 N                                                
 WS-YY     WS-TIFINLV        2 N                                                
 WS-WW     WS-TIFINLV  +2    2 N                                                
 WS-DAY    WS-TIFINLV  +4    1 N                                                
 KOLL-TIFINLV             W  5 N                                                
 KOLL-YY   KOLL-TIFINLV      2 N                                                
 KOLL-WW   WS-TIFINLV  +2    2 N                                                
 KOLL-DAY  WS-TIFINLV  +4    1 N                                                
 DAGENS-DATUM             W  5 N                                                
 DD-YY     DAGENS-DATUM      2 N                                                
 DD-WW     DAGENS-DATUM +2   2 N                                                
 DD-DAY    DAGENS-DATUM +4   1 N                                                
 WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV   W  2 P                                                
                                                                                
 W-TIERSDAT                    W  8 N                                           
 W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL  W-TIERSDAT     2 N                                           
 W-TIERSDAT-AAVVDD W-TIERSDAT +2  5 N                                           
                                                                                
 DATUM-10AR                   W  8 N                                            
 SEKEL-10        DATUM-10AR      2 N                                            
 DATUM-10-AAVVD  DATUM-10AR +2   5 N                                            
                                                                                
%WY2000W2                                                                       
%WWPRODSL  'TMP-ART-' WORK ''                                                   
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
* STEG 1. MATCHAR ARTFIL & BUY-BACK FIL TILL TEMPFIL1              *            
* -----------------------------------------------------------------*            
*                                                                               
JOB INPUT (W11621D1 KEY(BB-IDARTNR) W11621D2 KEY(ART-IDARTNR))      +           
                                    START  A-INIT                               
                                                                                
    IF MATCHED                                                                  
       W-KDBBCL = BB-KDBBCL                                                     
       PERFORM S01-SKRIV-POST                                                   
    ELSE                                                                        
      IF W11621D2                                                               
         W-KDBBCL = 0                                                           
         PERFORM S01-SKRIV-POST                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
    END-IF                                                                      
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
 A-INIT.  PROC                                                                  
                                                                                
 DATUM1 = SYSDATE                                                               
 AA2 = AA1                                                                      
 MM2 = MM1                                                                      
 DD2 = DD1                                                                      
 DAT-I-TIDATUM = DATUM                                                          
 DAT-KDDATFORM = 'AAMMDD'                                                       
 CALL WDATKONV USING (DAT-KDDATFORM, DAT-I-TIDATUM, DAT-O-TIDATUM,  +           
                      DAT-KDSVAR)                                               
                                                                                
*** HELP-DATE ANVÄNDS VID UTRÄKNING AV RETUR-STATUSKOD                          
 HELP-DATE = DAT-TIAAVVD                                                        
 HELP-DAY  = 1                                                                  
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
 S01-SKRIV-POST.    PROC                                                        
                                                                                
                                                                                
    PERFORM S02-RED-SKRIV-TEMPPOST                                              
    PUT TEMPFIL1                                                                
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
 S02-RED-SKRIV-TEMPPOST.  PROC                                                  
                                                                                
    TMP-ART-IDARTNR    = ART-IDARTNR                                            
    TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP   = ART-IDFKNGRP                                           
    TMP-ART-KDSRA      = ART-KDSRA                                              
    TMP-ART-KVQPACK-0  = ART-KVQPACK-0                                          
    TMP-ART-KDARTURS   = ART-KDARTURS                                           
    TMP-ART-KDPRODSL   = ART-KDPRODSL                                           
    TMP-ART-VLARTNTO   = ART-VLARTNTO                                           
    TMP-ART-VKART      = ART-VKART                                              
    TMP-ART-KDVSOP     = ART-KDVSOP                                             
    TMP-ART-IDSTATNR (1) = ART-IDSTATNR (1)                                     
    TMP-ART-IDSTATNR (2) = ART-IDSTATNR (2)                                     
    TMP-ART-IDSTATNR (3) = ART-IDSTATNR (3)                                     
    TMP-ART-IDSTATNR (4) = ART-IDSTATNR (4)                                     
    TMP-ART-IDSTATNR (5) = ART-IDSTATNR (5)                                     
    TMP-ART-KDSORT     = ART-KDSORT                                             
    TMP-ART-KDERS      = ART-KDERS                                              
    TMP-ART-KDBPSR     = ART-KDBPSR                                             
    TMP-ART-KDBBCL     = W-KDBBCL                                               
    TMP-ART-IDLEVNR    = ART-IDLEVNR                                            
    TMP-ART-KDAGE      = ART-KDAGE                                              
    TMP-ART-IDPROJ     = ART-IDPROJ                                             
    TMP-ART-PRARTSJK   = ART-PRARTSJK                                           
    TMP-ART-PRARTSTD   = ART-PRARTSTD                                           
    TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC   = ART-KDPSLLOC                                           
    TMP-ART-TIFINLV    = ART-TIFINLV                                            
    TMP-ART-KDERS-UTG  = ART-KDERS-UTG                                          
    TMP-ART-KDTIPPR    = ART-KDTIPPR                                            
    TMP-ART-KDUART     = ART-KDUART                                             
    TMP-ART-IDKAT  (1) = ART-IDKAT (1)                                          
    TMP-ART-IDKAT  (2) = ART-IDKAT (2)                                          
    TMP-ART-IDKAT  (3) = ART-IDKAT (3)                                          
    TMP-ART-BELEVART   = ART-BELEVART                                           
    TMP-ART-FLGEMFMC   = ART-FLGEMFMC                                           
    TMP-ART-IDPROJUP   = ART-IDPROJUP                                           
    TMP-ART-TIERSDAT   = ART-TIERSDAT                                           
    TMP-ART-TIURPROD   = ART-TIURPROD                                           
                                                                                
    IX1 = 1                                                                     
    DO WHILE IX1 < 11                                                           
       TMP-ART-IDSKYLT(IX1) = ART-IDSKYLT(IX1)                                  
       TMP-ART-BEART(IX1)= ART-BEART(IX1)                                       
       IX1 = IX1 + 1                                                            
    END-DO                                                                      
 END-PROC                                                                       
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
* STEG 2.                                                          *            
* -----------------------------------------------------------------*            
JOB INPUT W11621D3 START A-INIT FINISH Z-FINIT                                  
*                                                                               
   PERFORM S23-CHECK-IN84-SLAG-IDDC                                             
   IF IN84-SLAG-IDDC = NDC-CN                                                   
     IF NDC-IDARTNR = 0 OR NDC-IDARTNR NE IN84-SLAG-IDARTNR                     
       IF NDC-IDARTNR NE 0                                                      
         NDC-KVLS = SUM-KVLS                                                    
         NDC-KVAKS = SUM-KVAKS                                                  
         NDC-KVOKS = SUM-KVOKS                                                  
         NDC-KVRESS = SUM-KVRESS                                                
         NDC-KVROS = SUM-KVROS                                                  
         NDC-KVPB-SEP = SUM-KVPB-SEP                                            
         PUT NDCFIL                                                             
       END-IF                                                                   
       SUM-KVLS = 0                                                             
       SUM-KVAKS = 0                                                            
       SUM-KVOKS = 0                                                            
       SUM-KVRESS = 0                                                           
       SUM-KVROS = 0                                                            
       SUM-KVPB-SEP = 0                                                         
       NDC-KDLEVSP  = IN84-SLAG-KDLEVSP                                         
       NDC-FLORDSP  = IN84-SLAG-FLORDSP                                         
       NDC-KDARTURS = '  '                                                      
       NDC-IDLEVNR  = '    '                                                    
     END-IF                                                                     
     SUM-KVLS   = SUM-KVLS + IN84-SLAG-KVLS                                     
     SUM-KVAKS  = SUM-KVAKS + IN84-SLAG-KVAKS-PAV + IN84-SLAG-KVAKS-SDC         
     SUM-KVOKS  = SUM-KVOKS + IN84-SLAG-KVOKS-BULK + IN84-SLAG-KVOKS-DAG        
     SUM-KVRESS = SUM-KVRESS + IN84-SLAG-KVRESS                                 
     SUM-KVROS  = SUM-KVROS + IN84-SLAG-KVROS-BULK + IN84-SLAG-KVROS-DAG        
     SUM-KVPB-SEP = SUM-KVPB-SEP + IN84-SLAG-KVPB-REF                           
                                                                                
     NDC-IDARTNR  = IN84-SLAG-IDARTNR                                           
     NDC-IDDC     = IN84-SLAG-IDDC                                              
                                                                                
     IF NDC-IDLEVNR = '  '                                                      
       NDC-IDLEVNR  = IN84-SLAG-IDLEVNR                                         
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     NDC-KDREFSTA = IN84-SLAG-KDREFSTA                                          
                                                                                
*  NÅGON SKALL VARA 20 ELLER ALLA SKALL VARA > ZERO                             
     IF NDC-KDLEVSP NE 20                                                       
       IF IN84-SLAG-KDLEVSP = 20                                                
         NDC-KDLEVSP = 20                                                       
       ELSE                                                                     
         IF NDC-KDLEVSP GT 0                                                    
           IF IN84-SLAG-KDLEVSP = 0                                             
             NDC-KDLEVSP  = 0                                                   
           END-IF                                                               
         END-IF                                                                 
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
*                                                                               
*  ALLA SKALL VARA JA                                                           
     IF NDC-FLORDSP = 'J'                                                       
       IF IN84-SLAG-FLORDSP NE 'J'                                              
         NDC-FLORDSP = 'N'                                                      
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
     IF NDC-KDARTURS = '  '                                                     
        IF IN84-SLAG-KDARTURS NE '  '                                           
           IF IN84-SLAG-IDLEVNR NE '1441' 'BP2TW'                               
              NDC-KDARTURS = IN84-SLAG-KDARTURS                                 
           END-IF                                                               
        END-IF                                                                  
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
 A-INIT. PROC                                                                   
  NDC-IDARTNR = 0                                                               
 END-PROC                                                                       
                                                                                
 Z-FINIT. PROC                                                                  
   PUT NDCFIL                                                                   
 END-PROC                                                                       
                                                                                
*                                                                               
*    --- S23-CHECK-IN84-SLAG-IDDC (MACRO PROCEDURE)                             
%WWDC02 'IN84-SLAG-'                                                            
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*------------------------------------------------------------------*            
* STEG 3. MATCHAR IHOP NDC-FILEN OCH TEMPFIL1, SKAPAR UTFIL        *            
* -----------------------------------------------------------------*            
JOB INPUT(NDCFIL KEY (NDC-IDARTNR) TEMPFIL1 KEY (TMP-ART-IDARTNR))              
*                                                                               
IF MATCHED                                                                      
                                                                                
   UT-IDARTNR       = TMP-ART-IDARTNR                                           
   UT-IDDC          = WS-IDDC-DC70                                              
   UT-IDFKNGRP      = TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP                                          
   UT-KDSRA         = TMP-ART-KDSRA                                             
   UT-KVQPACK-0     = TMP-ART-KVQPACK-0                                         
   UT-KDPRODSL      = TMP-ART-KDPRODSL                                          
   UT-VLARTNTO      = TMP-ART-VLARTNTO                                          
   UT-VKART         = TMP-ART-VKART                                             
   UT-KDVSOP        = TMP-ART-KDVSOP                                            
   UT-IDSTATNR      = TMP-ART-IDSTATNR(3)                                       
   UT-KDSORT        = TMP-ART-KDSORT                                            
   UT-KDERS         = TMP-ART-KDERS                                             
   UT-KDBPSR        = TMP-ART-KDBPSR                                            
   UT-KDBBCL        = TMP-ART-KDBBCL                                            
   UT-IDLEVNR       = TMP-ART-IDLEVNR                                           
   UT-KDAGE         = TMP-ART-KDAGE                                             
   UT-IDPROJ        = TMP-ART-IDPROJ                                            
   UT-PRARTSJK      = TMP-ART-PRARTSJK                                          
   UT-PRARTSTD      = TMP-ART-PRARTSTD                                          
   UT-BEART-L1      = TMP-ART-BEART(4)                                          
   UT-BEART-L2      = ' '                                                       
   UT-KDPSLLOC      = TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC                                          
   UT-TIFINLV       = TMP-ART-TIFINLV                                           
   UT-KDTIPPR       = TMP-ART-KDTIPPR                                           
   UT-IDKAT (1)     = TMP-ART-IDKAT (1)                                         
   UT-IDKAT (2)     = TMP-ART-IDKAT (2)                                         
   UT-IDKAT (3)     = TMP-ART-IDKAT (3)                                         
   UT-BELEVART      = TMP-ART-BELEVART                                          
   UT-FLGEMFMC      = TMP-ART-FLGEMFMC                                          
   UT-IDPROJUP      = TMP-ART-IDPROJUP                                          
   UT-TIURPROD      = TMP-ART-TIURPROD                                          
   UT-BEARTEXT      = ' '                                                       
                                                                                
   IF NDC-IDLEVNR NE '1441' 'BP2TW'                                             
      UT-IDLEVNR-LOC  = NDC-IDLEVNR                                             
      IF NDC-KDARTURS NE '  '                                                   
        UT-KDARTURS   = NDC-KDARTURS                                            
      ELSE                                                                      
        UT-KDARTURS   = TMP-ART-KDARTURS                                        
      END-IF                                                                    
   ELSE                                                                         
      UT-IDLEVNR-LOC  = '11'                                                    
      UT-KDARTURS     = TMP-ART-KDARTURS                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   W-KDSTANAUTG = ' '                                                           
                                                                                
   IF (TMP-ART-KDERS = 29 AND NDC-KVLS = 0)  OR                +                
       TMP-ART-KDERS = 52                                                       
      W-KDSTANAUTG = 'N'                                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF TMP-ART-KDERS = 24 AND NDC-KVLS = 0                                       
      W-KDSTANAUTG = 'V'                                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF TMP-ART-KDERS = 21 22 23 AND NDC-KVLS = 0                                 
      W-KDSTANAUTG = 'R'                                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   W-IDFKNGRP = TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP                                                
                                                                                
   IF TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC = 18 81 82 91 THRU 99 AND               +                
      W-IDFKNGRP-SERIE = 16 18                                                  
      IF ((TMP-ART-KDERS > 20 OR TMP-ART-KDERS-UTG > 20) AND   +                
         (NDC-KVLS > 0)) OR (NDC-KDREFSTA NE 'P' OR NDC-KVLS NE 0)              
         W-KDSTANAUTG = 'S'                                                     
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF NDC-KDLEVSP > 0                                                           
      W-FLBLOCK = 'J'                                                           
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF NDC-FLORDSP = 'J'                                                      
         W-FLBLOCK = 'J'                                                        
      ELSE                                                                      
         W-FLBLOCK = 'N'                                                        
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF W-FLBLOCK = 'J'                                                           
      W-KDSTANAUTG = 'U'                                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   UT-KDSTANAUTG    = W-KDSTANAUTG                                              
                                                                                
   W-TOT-LAGER = NDC-KVAKS + NDC-KVLS - NDC-KVOKS         +                     
               - NDC-KVRESS - NDC-KVROS                                         
                                                                                
******************* 3 ÅRS FÖRBRUKNING                                           
   W-FORBRUKNING = NDC-KVPB-SEP * 36                                            
                                                                                
   IF W-FORBRUKNING < W-TOT-LAGER                                               
      UT-FLOVRLAG = '0'                                                         
   ELSE                                                                         
      UT-FLOVRLAG = '1'                                                         
   END-IF                                                                       
***********                                                                     
***********                                                                     
                                                                                
   IF TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC = 51 52                                                  
      IF TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP = 9999                                                
         UT-FLOVRLAG = '1'                                                      
      END-IF                                                                    
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC = 71                                                  
         IF TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP = 419                                              
            UT-FLOVRLAG = '1'                                                   
         END-IF                                                                 
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   UT-FLSOFTWARE    = 'N'                                                       
   PUT W11621D4                                                                 
ELSE                                                                            
   IF TEMPFIL1                                                                  
      PERFORM B-KOLLA-WDK6-ART                                                  
      IF WS-ART-OK = JA                                                         
         PUT W11621D4                                                           
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
 B-KOLLA-WDK6-ART.  PROC                                                        
*                                                                               
   UT-IDARTNR       = TMP-ART-IDARTNR                                           
   UT-IDDC          = WS-IDDC-DC70                                              
   UT-IDFKNGRP      = TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP                                          
   UT-KDSRA         = TMP-ART-KDSRA                                             
   UT-KVQPACK-0     = TMP-ART-KVQPACK-0                                         
   UT-KDPRODSL      = TMP-ART-KDPRODSL                                          
   UT-VLARTNTO      = TMP-ART-VLARTNTO                                          
   UT-VKART         = TMP-ART-VKART                                             
   UT-KDVSOP        = TMP-ART-KDVSOP                                            
   UT-IDSTATNR      = TMP-ART-IDSTATNR(3)                                       
   UT-KDSORT        = TMP-ART-KDSORT                                            
   UT-KDERS         = TMP-ART-KDERS                                             
   UT-KDBPSR        = TMP-ART-KDBPSR                                            
   UT-KDBBCL        = TMP-ART-KDBBCL                                            
   UT-IDLEVNR       = TMP-ART-IDLEVNR                                           
   UT-KDAGE         = TMP-ART-KDAGE                                             
   UT-IDPROJ        = TMP-ART-IDPROJ                                            
   UT-PRARTSJK      = TMP-ART-PRARTSJK                                          
   UT-PRARTSTD      = TMP-ART-PRARTSTD                                          
   UT-BEART-L1      = TMP-ART-BEART(4)                                          
   UT-BEART-L2      = ' '                                                       
   UT-KDPSLLOC      = TMP-ART-KDPSLLOC                                          
   UT-TIFINLV       = TMP-ART-TIFINLV                                           
   UT-KDTIPPR       = TMP-ART-KDTIPPR                                           
   UT-IDKAT(1)      = TMP-ART-IDKAT(1)                                          
   UT-IDKAT(2)      = TMP-ART-IDKAT(2)                                          
   UT-IDKAT(3)      = TMP-ART-IDKAT(3)                                          
   UT-BELEVART      = TMP-ART-BELEVART                                          
   UT-FLGEMFMC      = TMP-ART-FLGEMFMC                                          
   UT-IDPROJUP      = TMP-ART-IDPROJUP                                          
   UT-TIURPROD      = TMP-ART-TIURPROD                                          
   UT-BEARTEXT      = ' '                                                       
                                                                                
   HELP-DATE = DAT-TIAAVVD                                                      
   HELP-DAY  = 1                                                                
   WS-TIFINLV = TMP-ART-TIFINLV                                                 
                                                                                
   TMP1-YYWWD = HELP-DATE                                                       
   TMP2-YYWWD = WS-TIFINLV                                                      
   PERFORM WY2000P2                                                             
   DAGENS-DATUM = TMP1-YYWWD                                                    
   KOLL-TIFINLV = TMP2-YYWWD                                                    
                                                                                
   IF KOLL-YY > DD-YY                                                           
      WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = WS-WW + 53 - HELP-WW                             
   ELSE                                                                         
     IF HELP-YY = WS-YY                                                         
       IF WS-WW > HELP-WW                                                       
          WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = WS-WW - HELP-WW                              
       ELSE                                                                     
          WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = 0                                            
       END-IF                                                                   
     ELSE                                                                       
       WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV = 0                                               
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   IF TMP-ART-TIERSDAT > 0                                                      
     IF TMP-ART-TIERSDAT > 50000                                                
       W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL EQ 19                                                   
     ELSE                                                                       
       W-TIERSDAT-SEKEL EQ 20                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
     W-TIERSDAT-AAVVDD = TMP-ART-TIERSDAT                                       
   ELSE                                                                         
     W-TIERSDAT = 99999999                                                      
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   PERFORM S25-CHECK-TMP-ART-KDPRODSL                                           
                                                                                
   IF WS-VECKOR-TILL-TIFINLV > 30        +                                      
   OR W-TIERSDAT          < DATUM-10AR   +                                      
   OR TMP-ART-KDERS-UTG    > 0           +                                      
   OR TMP-ART-KDERS        EQ 52         +                                      
   OR TMP-ART-IDFKNGRP     = 0           +                                      
   OR TMP-ART-KDPRODSL     = 0           +                                      
   OR TMP-ART-KDPRODSL     = KDPRODSL-BIMA-LOCAL                                
      WS-ART-OK = 'N'                                                           
   ELSE                                                                         
      UT-IDLEVNR-LOC  = '11'                                                    
      UT-KDARTURS     = TMP-ART-KDARTURS                                        
      UT-KDSTANAUTG   = ' '                                                     
      UT-FLOVRLAG     = '1'                                                     
      UT-FLSOFTWARE   = 'N'                                                     
      WS-ART-OK = 'J'                                                           
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
 END-PROC                                                                       
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
%WY2000P2                                                                       
%WWPRODSL 'TMP-ART-' PROC ''                                                    
